  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">El Raval de Sant Josep acull durant tot aquest dissabte una nova edici&oacute; de la Fireta Solid&agrave;ria organitzada per l&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda. De mat&iacute; ha hagut un concert de pasdobles a c&agrave;rrec de la Banda Jove de la Uni&oacute; Musical i&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/P1019549-5.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>contacontes amb Valent&iacute; Pi&ntilde;ot Duxans.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/P1019568.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Al llarg de tota la jornada hi ha un castell&nbsp;unflable per&nbsp;a xiquets i xiquetes&nbsp;de Saltimbanquis Animaci&oacute;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/P1019584.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>i tallers infantils, a c&agrave;rrec de la Creu Roja.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/P1019552.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>A les 16.30 tornaran a obrir les casetes de les quinze associacions i ong. Si el temps ho permet, el programa previst per a la vesprada &eacute;s el seg&uuml;ent:</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">A les 17.30 h</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Ritmes del m&oacute;n</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">A c&agrave;rrec de<em>Dumtak Percussi&oacute;&nbsp;</em>i l&#39;Associaci&oacute; El MAT</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">A les 19.00 h</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Exhibici&oacute; de ball.&nbsp;A c&agrave;rrec de&nbsp; Associaci&oacute; Amics del Ball&nbsp;i Associaci&oacute; Riu Sec</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">A les 20.30 h</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Cloenda</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" s